---
source: crates/cli/tests/cli_output_snapshots.rs
expression: stdout
---
Diagnostic and monitoring commands

Usage: wheelctl diag [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  test     Run system diagnostics
  record   Record blackbox data
  replay   Replay blackbox recording
  support  Generate support bundle
  metrics  Show performance metrics
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json                 Output in JSON format for machine parsing
  -v, --verbose...           Verbose logging
      --no-mock              Fail if wheeld is unreachable instead of showing simulated data [env: WHEELCTL_NO_MOCK=1]
      --endpoint <ENDPOINT>  Service endpoint (for testing) [env: WHEELCTL_ENDPOINT=]
  -h, --help                 Print help
